# Hourly CI-telemetry publish at :17 past — staggered off the top of the hour so
# the heavy 24h /api/search doesn't collide with on-the-hour Tempo activity
# (exporter renders, scrape bursts) that was contributing to search timeouts.
# /etc/cron.d format: the 6th field is the user. stdout/stderr go to PID 1's fds
# so logs surface via `docker compose logs`. Env is sourced inside
# run-publish.sh (cron starts with a near-empty env).
17 * * * * root /usr/local/bin/run-publish.sh >> /proc/1/fd/1 2>> /proc/1/fd/2
